hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"21050","Hushaym narrated to us, Yunus ibn Ubayd informed us, an informant informed me, from Husayn ibn Abi al-Hurr, from al-Khashkhash al-Anbari, he said: I came to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) and with me was a son of mine, and he said: your son? He said: I said: yes. He said: he does not commit a crime against you, nor do you commit a crime against him."
